guarantee: AC-6: retry with an absent or stale id is a no-op; current settings; failed retry keeps the audio; FR-10 delivery (a failed retry shows the reason again: result dropped, no message, no offer)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/dictation.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
            Done::Retry(key, Some(report)) => {
                st.ctrl.retry_finished(key, report.end, report.pending, now)
            }
--- new
            Done::Retry(key, Some(_report)) => st.ctrl.retry_dropped(key, now),
--- end
